## Skills

skill-engineering-name = Engineering
skill-engineering-desc = Construction and general tool work. Prying, screwing, anchoring, welding and cutting go faster.
skill-electrical-name = Electrical
skill-electrical-desc = Wiring and power systems. Hacking and opening wire panels is much faster; the untrained are slow and clumsy at it.
skill-atmospherics-name = Atmospherics
skill-atmospherics-desc = Pipes, pumps and gas handling. Anchoring and welding atmos devices goes faster.
skill-robotics-name = Robotics
skill-robotics-desc = Building and repairing robots and cybernetics. Needed for the exosuit fabricator and robotic surgery. Requires Research.
skill-medicine-name = Medicine
skill-medicine-desc = First aid and medical treatment. Applying medical supplies is faster; the untrained are slower.
skill-surgery-name = Surgery
skill-surgery-desc = Needed to perform any surgery on organic patients, from incisions to organ transplants, implants and amputations. Surgery steps go a little faster.
skill-chemistry-name = Chemistry
skill-chemistry-desc = Needed to operate a chemical dispenser or ChemMaster.
skill-research-name = Research
skill-research-desc = Needed to operate the R&D console.
skill-xenoarchaeology-name = Xenoarchaeology
skill-xenoarchaeology-desc = Needed to operate the artifact analysis console.
skill-botany-name = Botany
skill-botany-desc = Harvesting and swabbing plants is twice as fast.
skill-cooking-name = Cooking
skill-cooking-desc = Butchering on a meat spike is twice as fast; the untrained are slower.
skill-security-training-name = Security Training
skill-security-training-desc = Restraint and search techniques. Cuffing, uncuffing and searching people is faster; the untrained are slower at cuffing.

