## Admin commands

cmd-skills_list-desc = Lists the skills a player's character knows.
cmd-skills_list-help = Usage: skills_list <player>
cmd-skills_grant-desc = Teaches a player's character a skill, ignoring prerequisites.
cmd-skills_grant-help = Usage: skills_grant <player> <skill id>
cmd-skills_revoke-desc = Removes a skill from a player's character.
cmd-skills_revoke-help = Usage: skills_revoke <player> <skill id>
skill-cmd-no-player = No online player called {$player}.
skill-cmd-no-body = {$player} isn't controlling a body.
